<p id="S4.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Theorem <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem5" title="Theorem 4.5 ‣ 4.1 Trees ‣ 4 Structural results ‣ Graph Irregularity via Edge Deletions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.5</span></a> proves that Conjecture <a href="#Thmconjecture1" title="Conjecture 1 ‣ 2 Preliminaries, first results and a conjecture ‣ Graph Irregularity via Edge Deletions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> holds for trees. For this family we can also compute the exact value of <math id="S4.SS1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\rm I}_{e}(G)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\rm I}_{e}(G)</annotation></semantics></math> with an efficient algorithm.</p>
